== H7
# H7: (a) per fn, the typed `let`s of a String / str collection (170 in 89 fns = g2b
# census.locals.tsv's rows with a `String` / `str` type token) ; (b) UNTYPED:
# `binding=callee` for a `let` with no type whose initializer calls a crate fn
# returning such a collection.
# §5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK1-1: gather_decl_positions returns `Keyed<u32>` (decl_pos's producer, retyped with the store): its
# `pos` row and the two `dpos=gather_decl_positions` bindings left H7 (a store value now, HS / H5 hold the store).
# §5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK1-2a: hoist_block_local_nets' `seen` is a KeyedSet of NewKeys (premise11 Q4): it left the typed-let count
# (2 -> 1 there ; H7_READERS keeps `seen`, still the fn's local collection, as g2b's reader list names it).
# §5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK1-2b: push_body_enum_labels returns its two saved Vecs keyed by NewKey (net_util.rs:529 :530): the four
# `saved_labels=push_body_enum_labels` UNTYPED bindings (frames_body.rs 2, inline_task.rs, inline_fn.rs) left H7.
# §5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK1-2c: the saved-key Vecs hold NewKeys (instance.rs:560, iface_inst.rs:225, package.rs:653 :657 :663 :665 :691 ;
# bind_params' return, params.rs:1572): saved_params left two rows, elaborate_package 22 -> 17 (saved_str stays: its value is
# `Option<String>`), and the two `bind_params` UNTYPED bindings (iface_inst.rs `sp=`, instance_array.rs `saved=`) left H7.
# §5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK1-4b-2 (2026-11-24): frames_static_init.rs emit_frame_static_prologue's `formals` (folded into `nonh`) and `admitted_keys` are KeyedSets of the walk's found keys (`extend_found`, N11-3 / C2) — no String collection: 3 -> 1 (cands)
# §5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK1-5a (2026-11-25): the hierarchical resolver moves into lexscope/hier.rs (MOVE 5, R-J2) — hier_resolve's `segs` re-homed
# §5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK1-5b (2026-11-25): decl_keep_snapshot STAYS in decl_scope.rs (R-J1) and hands its key list to lexscope: the `keys` collection it built (BTreeSet<&str>) is keys_under_cur's now (BTreeMap<&str, &NewKey>, lexscope/mod.rs) [DK1-6 (2026-11-25): ROUND 1's form, never built — the round-2 line below is the built state (newreads N9 (b))]
# §5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK1-5b round 2 (2026-11-25, the cost trip on the package path): keys_under_cur builds no collection of its own: it takes the caller's Vec<&NewKey> BY VALUE and sorts, dedups and filters it in place (no BTreeMap, no second Vec) ; its H7 row `keys_under_cur 1 keys` is gone
# §5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK3-a (2026-11-26): bind_iface_port's alias list moves with its loop into lexscope/elab.rs alias_iface_port (X15): 2 -> 1 (mp_dirs), + 1 (aliases)
