== HSTAY
# HSTAY (§5.2 Q-DECLKEY DK1-5b (2026-11-25), DELTA18 G1 / R-J1 STAYOUT ; engine test hstay_the_stayout_snapshot_is_pinned): a fn that STAYS outside lexscope and
# asks it one scope question is read whole — every call in its body by callee name (`.m` a method call, `f(` a path call, `m!` a
# macro), by (file, fn, call) with a count. decl_keep_snapshot builds `DeclKept` records of six store values ; its key list's
# order, dedup and prefix test are lexscope's (keys_under_cur), and its six probes are the typed `get_new`: a text operation
# written back (`.get` / `.contains_key` with text, `format!`, `starts_with`, `key_text`) is a new row or a moved count.
# Not seen: a call through a fn value, or a helper the body delegates to (the helper's calls are not read).
file	fn	call	count
